about = hero('ABOUT THE PRACTICE','A professional perspective shaped by service.','Rakesh Puri & Associates combines legal advocacy with decades of experience in policing and criminal investigation.')+'''<section class="section"><div class="shell content-grid"><div>'''+section('THE PRACTICE','Law. Investigation. Experience.')+'''</div><div class="prose"><p>Rakesh Kumar Puri is an advocate practising in Rajasthan. His professional background spans 35 years of police service and legal practice focused on criminal litigation and constitutional writ matters.</p><p>During police service, he held SHO and Circle Officer postings across Rajasthan and served as Additional Superintendent of Police with JDVVNL in Jodhpur and the Anti-Terrorist Squad in Jodhpur. His highest rank was Additional Superintendent of Police.</p><p>That experience provides a practical understanding of investigation records, witness accounts, forensic evidence and criminal procedure. In advocacy, those disciplines support careful case preparation and focused courtroom work.</p><p>Bar Council enrolment is stated as 2016. The client has also stated 11 years of legal practice; the chronology awaits confirmation before public release.</p></div></div></section><section class="section ivory"><div class="shell">'''+section('PROFESSIONAL FOUNDATIONS','Experience across two disciplines.')+'''<div class="two-cards"><article class="info-card"><span>01 / SERVICE</span><h3>Police service</h3><p>Thirty-five years of service, including field policing, SHO and Circle Officer postings, and Additional SP roles in Jodhpur.</p></article><article class="info-card"><span>02 / PRACTICE</span><h3>Legal advocacy</h3><p>Criminal law, constitutional writ matters, trial advocacy and evidence-focused case preparation.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell">'''+section('LEARN MORE','A closer look at the professional journey.')+'''<div class="link-row">'''+link('/professional-profile','Professional profile ↗')+link('/investigation-expertise','Investigation expertise ↗')+link('/practice-areas','Practice areas ↗')+'''</div></div></section>'''
