criminal = hero('PRACTICE AREA / 01','Criminal law.','Representation in criminal proceedings informed by an extensive background in investigation, evidence and procedure.',True)+'''<section class="section"><div class="shell content-grid"><div>'''+section('SCOPE OF WORK','From first records to final arguments.')+'''</div><div class="prose"><p>Criminal matters call for close attention to the investigation record, the legal elements of an offence and the evidence that can properly be placed before a court.</p><p>The practice includes trials, bail and anticipatory bail, appeals, revisions, quashing petitions and related criminal proceedings. Each matter is assessed on its own facts and the applicable law.</p></div></div><div class="shell detail-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Pre-trial & bail</h3><p>Bail and anticipatory bail, charge-sheet review, discharge and charge framing.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Trial advocacy</h3><p>Witness examination, cross-examination, evidentiary objections and final arguments.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Appellate work</h3><p>Appeals, revisions, quashing and related proceedings.</p></article></div></section><section class="section ivory"><div class="shell">'''+section('QUESTIONS OF EVIDENCE','Investigation knowledge in legal practice.')+'''<p class="wide-copy">Experience with documentary and electronic records, forensic and medical material, witness credibility and circumstantial evidence informs a methodical approach to criminal litigation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/investigation-expertise/">Read about investigation expertise ↗</a></div></section>'''
